  <ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder id="f-128" contextRef="c-36">The Respondent is a limited liability company formed in 2015 under the laws of the State of Delaware.&#160; As an LLC, the Respondent has not issued shares of stock or other similar securities.&#160; Rather, its equity is in the form of Membership Interests.&#160; 100% of the Membership Interests of the Respondent, and the right to vote the same, are owned by UGI Energy Services, LLC ("UGIES").</ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-129" contextRef="c-36" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">11</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder id="f-130" contextRef="c-37">The purchase of the Respondent's assets from Transcontinental Gas Pipeline Company on June 30, 2016 was financed by a capital contribution from UGIES.&#160; UGIES is a second-tier subsidiary of UGI Corporation, a publicly traded company (NYSE: "UGI").</ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder>
